e(\\\"view+2D+view softmax\\\", lambda: logits.view(BHL, L).softmax(dim=-1).view(B, H, L, L))\nprofile(\\\"direct 4D softmax\\\", lambda: logits.softmax(dim=-1))\nprofile(\\\"F.softmax 4D\\\", lambda: torch.nn.functional.softmax(logits, dim=-1))\n\n# What about log_softmax + exp? (probably slower, just checking)\nprofile(\\\"log_softmax + exp\\\", lambda: logits.view(BHL, L).log_softmax(dim=-1).exp_().view(B, H, L, L))\n\nPYEOF\npython3 /tmp/deep_profile2.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
